flowchart TB
    Learner[Learner<br/>external entity]
    Guardian[Guardian<br/>external entity]
    Author[Content Author<br/>external entity]
    Teacher[Teacher / Coordinator<br/>external entity]
    FBAuth[Firebase Auth<br/>external system]
    MailSvc[Email Service<br/>external system]

    P0(((0<br/>Code4Youth<br/>Learning System)))

    Learner -->|credentials, profile details,<br/>lesson answers, preferences| P0
    P0 -->|curriculum content, progress,<br/>XP, badges, resume point| Learner

    P0 -->|consent request email| MailSvc
    MailSvc -->|delivery| Guardian
    Guardian -->|approve or decline<br/>signed token| P0
    P0 -->|confirmation page| Guardian

    Author -->|module, lesson, step,<br/>challenge definitions| P0
    P0 -->|draft and published<br/>content, validation errors| Author

    Teacher -->|cohort queries| P0
    P0 -->|aggregate progress reports| Teacher

    P0 -->|ID token for verification| FBAuth
    FBAuth -->|uid, email_verified,<br/>token validity| P0
    P0 -->|verification and<br/>password reset triggers| FBAuth
